            "review_text": "Alex P\n7 contributions\n0\nGreat place for a romantic vibe dinner\nSep 2024 • Couples\nThe restaurant has a romantic vibe which is suitable for couple. We went there for dinner and the night was great. Their menu was Vietnamese fusion and easy to order. There were Vietnamese tapas which we ordered Cha Ca tapas - very tasty. Their smoked duck breast spaghetti was the best of the menu.\nWritten September 30, 2024",
